{
  "key": "open",
  "aliases": ["chat", "freeform"],
  "version": "2026-08-08.1",
  "stall_budget": {
    "tools": [
      "mcp:mathjs:evaluate",
      "mcp:investor-agent:historical_prices",
      "mcp:investor-agent:technical_indicator",
      "mcp:investor-agent:get_stock_info",
      "web.fetch",
      "web.search",
      "fetch_news",
      "fetch_news_sentiment",
      "update_plan",
      "workspace.context.snapshot",
      "research.thesis.write",
      "workspace.memory.search"
    ],
    "key": "tool_fingerprint",
    "max_success": 2,
    "on_exceed": "strip_from_surface"
  },
  "recovery": {
    "after_probe_failure": "continue_without_realtime",
    "forbid_gap_as_final_answer": false
  },
  "completion": {
    "artifacts": [],
    "required_tools": [],
    "answer_schema": {
      "required_sections": [],
      "min_chars": 80
    }
  },
  "checklist_prompt": [
    "同类工具（含相同参数指纹）成功 ≤2 次后必须停手，用已有 observation 写中文终答",
    "禁止把 web.fetch / web.search / mathjs / historical_prices / get_stock_info 当刷屏工具",
    "新闻任务优先 fetch_news / fetch_news_sentiment，不要连刷网页正文",
    "MCP 只用 mcp:<server>:<tool> 直连名，不要用 call_mcp",
    "有足够证据后下一轮只输出最终回答，不再发 tool_calls",
    "宁可给出带 [待核实] 的部分结论，也不要无限取数直到超时"
  ]
}
